ed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_S\">\\(\\le_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a566c9610179ba40\" href=\"?note=a566c9610179ba40\" title=\"43-df-solovay-red\">43-df-solovay-red</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}\">\\(\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\to\\beta\\le_S\\alpha\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\to\\beta\\le_S\\alpha\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 13.3.1 and Definition 13.3.2；印刷页 343–344，PDF 页 363–364。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-solovay-red","status":"resolved","id":"a566c9610179ba40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R$；$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$ 与 $\\le_S$ 见 [[43-df-solovay-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}(\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\alpha)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathbb R\\left(\\mathrm{LeftComputable}(\\beta)\\to\\beta\\le_S\\alpha\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1296,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-solovay-complete]] — Solovay Complete Left-c.e. Reals"},{"id":"a83a239aef6bae71","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 采用 [[43-df-mlrandom]] 的同名符号。 $\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-complete]] 的同名符号。"},{"id":"5c7f032a842f6b9a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathbb R$ 均满足 $\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$；$\\mathrm{SolovayComplete}$ 采用 [[43-df-solovay-complete]]，加法上确界采用 [[43-thm-solovay-addition-join]]。"}],"outgoing":["a566c9610179ba40"]}